    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[0].text
      value: Executive Trial is now unlocked.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[1].icon
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -2137491507043576462, guid: 41d5e788d0a97453fbb3734ae1ce83b1, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[1].text
      value: Executive Trial is a high-risk operation mode where every decision carries
        lasting impact.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[2].icon
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[2].text
      value: If a Bitling is lost during an Executive Trial run, it cannot be recovered
        for the remainder of that operation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[3].icon
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[3].text
      value: Manage your team carefully, balancing recruitment, replacement, recovery,
        and evolution to maintain stability.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[4].icon
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[4].text
      value: Advance through as many Rift Operations as possible before the run concludes,
        with performance reflected in your final record.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[5].icon
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[5].text
      value: Enter Executive Trial when prepared to operate under these conditions.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7178327539474743040, guid: e2a738edca0ab1341b3614d8ebf7e6b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[9].icon
