--- !u!114 &2106110971
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2106110969}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 886766c76dce8114e980230b8bf3cd35, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  storyGroup: {fileID: 2106110972}
  tapButton: {fileID: 1664641449}
  headerText: {fileID: 1976235607}
  bodyText: {fileID: 435968784}
  pageCounterText: {fileID: 1658407702}
  pages:
  - header: Welcome to the Bitling World
    body: "Bitlings are living workers that sustain the world\u2019s operations.\nEach
      one carries the ability to learn, adapt, and contribute across BRN job sites."
  - header: A Working Species
    body: "Bitlings are not just companions\u2014they are the workforce.\nEach type
      is suited for specific roles, supporting sites such as the Forge, Harbor, and
      Cryo Lab to maintain steady resource production."
  - header: The Rift Crisis
    body: 'Recently, unstable Rifts have begun appearing across multiple regions.

      Bitlings
      are emerging displaced, unassigned, or in unstable condition, placing both
      operations and infrastructure at risk.'
  - header: The Bitling Research Network
    body: 'To stabilize conditions and protect Bitlings, the Bitling Research Network
      (BRN) was established.

      Its mission is to recover displaced Bitlings,
      assign them to appropriate roles, restore operational output, and investigate
      the source of the Rifts.'
  - header: Your New Role
    body: 'You have been assigned as a BRN Handler.

      Your role is to train
      Bitlings, manage assignments, monitor fatigue, and maintain efficient operation
      of all job sites during the ongoing crisis.'
  - header: The Bitling Research Network
    body: 'BRN operatives function under standardized identity protocols.

      Personal
      identifiers such as names or appearance are not required for operational effectiveness.

      All
      personnel are recognized by designation and role.'
  - header: Your Designation
    body: 'You are now registered as:

      [INSERT ID DESIGNATION]

      BRN Handler

      This
      designation grants you authority over Bitling management, training direction,
      fatigue regulation, and production stability.'
  - header: Begin Your Operation
    body: 'Each operation begins with a single assigned Bitling.

      Select a
      starter, guide its development, and begin restoring stability across BRN operations.'
  selfPanelId: 30
  introPanelId: 1
  homePanelId: 4
  replaceTokens: 1
