--- !u!114 &3478425213018426440
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4309526258840737429}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_battle_advanced_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 0
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Damage is calculated through layered factors, including attack versus
      defense, Title adjustments, type alignment, and resistance.

      Small advantages
      combine to produce stronger overall outcomes.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Titles influence performance by modifying offensive output, defensive
      strength, and resistance to incoming types.

      These adjustments are applied
      before final damage is resolved.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Some Titles activate at the start of an engagement, providing shields,
      conditional boosts, or early adjustments that shape initial momentum.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Status systems become available once Synergy is unlocked, introducing ongoing
      effects that influence turn flow and control.
  overlayRoot: {fileID: 7658924977972708531}
  dimmerImage: {fileID: 8462323521906036032}
  iconImage: {fileID: 533313777639230291}
